  "description": "Save and load for Noodloft components. Source-generated JSON, pluggable stores, per-entry\n            versioning, and a merging save that does not wipe the state of scenes that are not loaded.\n            Configuration is never written to disk, so rebalancing takes effect on existing saves.",
